-- title:
--   Every eligible node's last committed configuration is empty, a bootstrap configuration, or a committed one
-- statement:
--   For every payload type `V`, cluster parameters `P` with `P.InitCompatible` and `P.strategy = ElectionStrategy.DEFAULT_INSTANCE`, every cluster `W` with `Reachable P W` and every node `n` with `P.eligible n = true`: `(W.node n).lastCommittedConfiguration = VotingConfiguration.EMPTY_CONFIG` (for instance at a node that has not bootstrapped), or `P.initConfs (W.node n).lastCommittedConfiguration` (a bootstrap configuration), or some sent publication `W.sent (.publishRequest src s pt pv)` with `Committed W s.term s.version` has `s.lastAcceptedConfiguration = (W.node n).lastCommittedConfiguration`.
